{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/e1f440fc3247b42b8ab51340ce9e7b53.avif?t=1761222690\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an intergalactic journey in <strong>Stellar Destiny: The Last Survivor</strong>, a fast-paced, action-packed sci-fi adventure where survival hinges on your ability to slay monstrous foes, craft powerful gear, and explore uncharted planets. Step into the role of a sentient AI ship, the last of its kind, as it traverses the cosmos, gathering chemical elements and unraveling the mysteries of the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore planets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/e7a6c792ba253159f8c6a8117456437a.poster.avif?t=1761222690\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/e7a6c792ba253159f8c6a8117456437a.webm?t=1761222690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore planets and mine rare elements on each planet. However, be aware that each planet has its unique flora and fauna, which will not be friendly and will defend itself against invasive AI. Each planet has its specific theme and will challenge you differently.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slay enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/708f2dced1ec699ebd9d73d3f76d5242.poster.avif?t=1761222690\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/708f2dced1ec699ebd9d73d3f76d5242.webm?t=1761222690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay enemies with unique weapons and combinations of skills. You will be using your trusty sword and drone, which have unique skills to help you in combat. Is laser your preferred weapon in combination with a flaming sword? Or would you rather slay enemies in a whirlwind of acid while your drone spits out rockets? The choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft your gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/a26b7d33b8d8274bade9972be692485f.poster.avif?t=1761222690\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/a26b7d33b8d8274bade9972be692485f.webm?t=1761222690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need upgrades and good gear to survive in a hostile environment. You will be able to do so with elements you will mine on each planet! Craft unique compounds that will boost specific stats and create unique combos so your AI can have a time of its li... computing power, while slaying thousands of native animals</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominate!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dominate the galaxy and build up the AI to fearlessly wander through the galaxy? The time is now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/d4e73b68f4bd9a8c9778854985dca0bd.avif?t=1761222690\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650690?